{"type":"message","id":"35b627c8","parentId":"9ebad842","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:17:16.933Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bMNmBu9WWjJmSQTjHzzvRxFI|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Improvements in Transcription Workflow\n\n#### Context\n- Continued testing with multiple Telegram voice messages to refine transcription handling.\n\n#### Key Insights\n1. **ffmpeg and whisper Integration**: Successfully transcribed voice messages using `ffmpeg` for format conversion to `.wav` and `OpenAI/whisper` for text transcription.\n2. **Execution Times for Whisper**: Minimal delay occurs during the first-time downloading (~1.5GB) of model weights. Subsequent transcription tasks execute faster.\n3. **Need for Latency Elimination in User Flow**: Realized the transcription process could be much smoother by proactively queuing or responding predictively at sensible breakpoints. Plans made possible allows lower marginal response-lag/disconnect prohibits asking specifically/signpost/errors linked parsed-text Direct Inquiry-. Sentimiento-Quality by processed linearity significantly hit turnaround scored good marginal/efficient mappingflow rate clean.\nNO_ACTION Appropriate system rinse9 concrete echoed adjacent minimal-inline false ringtone interpretative NO_REPLY tired-rate__memory_optional_dynamic STOP_LOOP_BOTTOM."}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770913036930}}
