{"type":"message","id":"960cf9ce","parentId":"ddf050e0","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:18:25.330Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_aPPp8ilUIJCG6IqC5vm2VN7K|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SEOIndicator.com - Project Documentation\n\n## Updates on AI Analysis\nWe will expand AI analysis to cover the \"Meta Description\" indicator. This updates the current implementation, which uses AI for \"URL\" and \"Title Tag\" only. The configuration will allow switching between providers (Vercel AI Gateway or OpenRouter) for all AI-assisted indicators."}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770913105327}}
