{"type":"message","id":"3d351ff9","parentId":"76d77026","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:20:35.958Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_XWEPIPl1fP9wH10wQ0cjyv68|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// meta-description-indicator.spec.js\n\nconst { test } = require('@playwright/test');\n\ntest.describe('SEO Indicator Tests', () => {\n  test('Meta Description AI Analysis Validation', async ({ page }) => {\n    await page.goto('http://localhost/');\n\n    await page.fill('#domain-input', 'example.com');\n    await page.click('#start-analysis-btn');\n    await page.waitForSelector('.progress-completed');\n\n    const result = await page.textContent('.indicator-meta-description');\n    expect(result).toContain('Static Analysis:');\n    expect(result).toContain('AI:');\n  });\n});"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770913235953}}
{"type":"message","id":"4a952823","parentId":"3d351ff9","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:20:51.732Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning meta description analyzer tests**\n\nI'm focusing on improving meta description extraction logic, handling multiple tags, case insensitivity, and edge cases in `metaDescriptionAnalyzer.js`. Next, I'll create lightweight Jest unit tests to verify these enhancements without relying on unavailable Playwright UI tests.\n\n**Designing AI-driven meta description analysis**\n\nI'm planning to create a structured analysis module that handles i18n-aware length measurement, detects issues, and optionally integrates AI suggestions if API keys exist. I'll also explore implementing core AI logic server-side in `seo_logic.php` alongside existing migration updates.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Planning meta description analyzer tests**\\n\\nI'm focusing on improving meta description extraction logic, handling multiple tags, case insensitivity, and edge cases in `metaDescriptionAnalyzer.js`. Next, I'll create lightweight Jest unit tests to verify these enhancements without relying on unavailable Playwright UI tests.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"},{\"text\":\"**Designing AI-driven meta description analysis**\\n\\nI'm planning to create a structured analysis module that handles i18n-aware length measurement, detects issues, and optionally integrates AI suggestions if API keys exist. I'll also explore implementing core AI logic server-side in `seo_logic.php` alongside existing migration updates.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_xiWwuqmbOwL3O8cB4bKqbI2f|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\database\\migrations\\2026_02_12_1657_add_meta_description_column.sql"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Deskt