{"type":"message","id":"9dee2fbb","parentId":"65ccb2b4","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:21:00.611Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_VYYZhhsa1yDkDRvA4jF8IKE9|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?php\nnamespace SEOIndicator;\n\nabstract class Indicator {\n    protected string $name;\n\n    public function __construct(string $name) {\n        $this->name = $name;\n    }\n\n    public function getName(): string {\n        return $this->name;\n    }\n\n    abstract public function analyze(array $data): array;\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770913260606}}
{"type":"message","id":"d5100712","parentId":"9dee2fbb","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:21:26.807Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning AI meta-description module**\n\nPlanning to create a new AI-driven meta-description analysis module with multi-lingual heuristics and summarization, upgrading the existing simple analyzer. I'll scope new Jest unit tests separately to enable TDD without running potentially failing existing tests.\n\n**Designing robust meta-description analysis**\n\nMapping detailed parsing enhancements for meta description extraction to handle HTML variations, case insensitivity, and attribute order. Planning to decode HTML entities, support Unicode-aware length measurement using Intl.Segmenter if available, and detect language scripts for tailored heuristics. The analysis will return a rich result object with compatibility fallback to existing formats, enabling AI-driven insights and relevance scoring while maintaining backward compatibility for current tests.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Planning AI meta-description module**\\n\\nPlanning to create a new AI-driven meta-description analysis module with multi-lingual heuristics and summarization, upgrading the existing simple analyzer. I'll scope new Jest unit tests separately to enable TDD without running potentially failing existing tests.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"},{\"text\":\"**Designing robust meta-description analysis**\\n\\nMapping detailed parsing enhancements for meta description extraction to handle HTML variations, case insensitivity, and attribute order. Planning to decode HTML entities, support Unicode-aware length measurement using Intl.Segmenter if available, and detect language scripts for tailored heuristics. The analysis will return a rich result object with compatibility fallback to existing formats, enabling AI-driven insights and relevance scoring while maintaining backward compatibility for current tests.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_LsdkoQrBczKTUTk252veDQDV|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\config.php"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\\\config.php\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":1016,"output":1566,"cacheRead":189056,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":191638,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770913260611}}
