{"type":"message","id":"50001a2f","parentId":"1a3c8992","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:24:03.228Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning AI meta description analysis**\n\nDeciding to implement meta description analysis with heuristics in JS for easier testing, optionally invoking AI if keys are present while supporting offline fallback. The core logic may integrate with existing PHP AI functions but focus on JS for coverage and i18n handling.\n\n**Designing comprehensive JS meta description analysis**\n\nI've defined a detailed plan to implement a robust JS meta description analyzer handling extraction with regex, i18n-aware length evaluation using grapheme counts and script detection, relevancy scoring via token overlap with title/body, and issue/suggestion reporting. This includes fallback priorities for meta tag sources and structured output for integration and testing.\n\n**Detailing meta description extraction and analysis approach**\n\nOutlined concrete parsing methods for meta tags, title, language, and content extraction using regex, plus strategies for script detection, length evaluation by graphemes with i18n-aware thresholds, relevancy scoring via token overlap, and issue/suggestion generation. Also planned a comprehensive TDD suite covering these edge cases and integration notes.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Planning AI meta description analysis**\\n\\nDeciding to implement meta description analysis with heuristics in JS for easier testing, optionally invoking AI if keys are present while supporting offline fallback. The core logic may integrate with existing PHP AI functions but focus on JS for coverage and i18n handling.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"},{\"text\":\"**Designing comprehensive JS meta description analysis**\\n\\nI've defined a detailed plan to implement a robust JS meta description analyzer handling extraction with regex, i18n-aware length evaluation using grapheme counts and script detection, relevancy scoring via token overlap with title/body, and issue/suggestion reporting. This includes fallback priorities for meta tag sources and structured output for integration and testing.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"},{\"text\":\"**Detailing meta description extraction and analysis approach**\\n\\nOutlined concrete parsing methods for meta tags, title, language, and content extraction using regex, plus strategies for script detection, length evaluation by graphemes with i18n-aware thresholds, relevancy scoring via token overlap, and issue/suggestion generation. Also planned a comprehensive TDD suite covering these edge cases and integration notes.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_nYVWd3P3YdGVx6WlmaOFb77x|","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File | Select-String -Pattern \"meta-description-analyzer\"","workdir":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com"},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File | Select-String -Pattern \\\"meta-description-analyzer\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":191916,"output":8819,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":200735,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770913286836}}
