{"type":"message","id":"fa0794cc","parentId":"41bbf456","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:26:42.530Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Updating project documentation**\n\nI'm enhancing docs/PROJECT.md with details about the new AI-driven meta description analyzer, including its extraction process, multilingual length rules, relevancy scoring, issue detection, and suggestion features.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Updating project documentation**\\n\\nI'm enhancing docs/PROJECT.md with details about the new AI-driven meta description analyzer, including its extraction process, multilingual length rules, relevancy scoring, issue detection, and suggestion features.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_xvLI0EZo852gtM33F6T2tqln|","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\docs\\PROJECT.md","oldText":"# SEOIndicator.com - Project Documentation\n\n## Updates on AI Analysis\nWe will expand AI analysis to cover the \"Meta Description\" indicator. This updates the current implementation, which uses AI for \"URL\" and \"Title Tag\" only. The configuration will allow switching between providers (Vercel AI Gateway or OpenRouter) for all AI-assisted indicators.\n","newText":"# SEOIndicator.com - Project Documentation\n\n## Updates on AI Analysis\nWe expanded AI analysis to cover the **Meta Description** indicator with a dedicated AI-driven analyzer.\n\n### Meta Description AI Analyzer (new)\nThe analyzer now provides structured AI insights beyond basic length checks:\n- **Robust extraction**: Handles mixed attribute order, multiple meta tags, and HTML entity decoding.\n- **Internationalization-aware length rules**:\n  - Latin/default: 50–160 chars (ideal 120–160)\n  - CJK/Thai: 40–120 chars (ideal 60–110)\n- **Relevancy scoring**: Compares description tokens to title/H1/body context and grades relevance (low/medium/good).\n- **Issue detection**: Missing/empty content, too short/long, duplicate title, keyword stuffing, and low relevance.\n- **Actionable suggestions**: Outputs targeted fixes with context-aware keyword hints.\n- **AI summary output**: Produces a concise, human-readable “AI Analysis” summary for UI or API use.\n\nThis update ensures coverage for edge cases, internationalized content, diverse content lengths, and relevancy.\n"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\\\docs\\\\PROJECT.md\",\"oldText\":\"# SEOIndicator.com - Project Documentation\\n\\n## Updates on AI Analysis\\nWe will expand AI analysis to cover the \\\"Meta Description\\\" indicator. This updates the current implementation, which uses AI for \\\"URL\\\" and \\\"Title Tag\\\" only. The configuration will allow switching between providers (Vercel AI Gateway or OpenRouter) for all AI-assisted indicators.\\n\",\"newText\":\"# SEOIndicator.com - Project Documentation\\n\\n## Updates on AI Analysis\\nWe expanded AI analysis to cover the **Meta Description** indicator with a dedicated AI-driven analyzer.\\n\\n### Meta Description AI Analyzer (new)\\nThe analyzer now provides structured AI insights beyond basic length checks:\\n- **Robust extraction**: Handles mixed attribute order, multiple meta tags, and HTML entity decoding.\\n- **Internationalization-aware length rules**:\\n  - Latin/default: 50–160 chars (ideal 120–160)\\n  - CJK/Thai: 40–120 chars (ideal 60–110)\\n- **Relevancy scoring**: Compares description tokens to title/H1/body context and grades relevance (low/medium/good).\\n- **Issue detection**: Missing/empty content, too short/long, duplicate title, keyword stuffing, and low relevance.\\n- **Actionable suggestions**: Outputs targeted fixes with context-aware keyword hints.\\n- **AI summary output**: Produces a concise, human-readable “AI Analysis” summary for UI or API use.\\n\\nThis update ensures coverage for edge cases, internationalized content, diverse content lengths, and relevancy.\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":7026,"output":470,"cacheRead":205312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":212808,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770913593735}}
